#ASSERT     `the entry names the thing` (`entry` land) "any right in or over land" FALSE
#ASSERT     `the entry names the thing` (`entry` land) "any interest in or over land" FALSE
-- F48: both the item as the line prints it and each thing it lists are members; a thing the line does not list still refuses
#ASSERT REFUSED `the entry names the thing` (`entry` land) "houses and gardens" FALSE BECAUSE "an entry that says includes does not close the list, so a thing it does not name is not answered"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the entry names the thing` (`entry` land) "any lease, estate or interest in or over land" FALSE BECAUSE "an entry that says includes does not close the list, so a thing it does not name is not answered"
